    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Karnataka serves as a hub for the Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO).",
        "The state houses several premier defence and scientific research institutions.",
        "Important educational institutions in Karnataka contribute significantly to science and technology.",
        "Nuclear and energy institutions form a strategic part of Karnataka's scientific infrastructure."
